inysunny14344", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039447356/", "num_games_owned": 338, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 148, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 148, "last_played": 1488307176, "avatar": "fc13bb1f59388dc6070a14f9224b6f697e08a4d3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Terrible.\nCant say the reasons because I will get banned in this \"free speech\" world.\n\nlolololol\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1617233768, "timestamp_updated": 1617233768, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "89464583", "author": {"steamid": "76561198166998015", "personaname": "Rollo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198166998015/", "num_games_owned": 185, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 758, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 565, "last_played": 1617584403, "avatar": "c841a3586115e394c8e7e775d40894c4947e79f0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Over all i would say this game is not worth it.\nA lot of parts of this game are great such as the graphics and the textures. It does have glitches but its playable 100%.\n\nThe reasons this game is not worth it: \nGetting into combat is hard and very time consuming, you spawn 3000m from the battle zone to travel there you need a vehicle which unless you have DLC's you wont have which means depending on someone else to take you there. This will then result in you're vehicle being destroyed 9/10 on the way to the battlezone. \nIf you survive long enough to get to the battlezone you will likely be killed very fast by enemy players with OP armour and weapons which will wreck your level 1 armour and youre weapon will do next to nothing to them thats if you actually see them. Chances are you will be shot by a sniper over 1000m away that you never see, who has DLC advantage. \nThe DLC provide a huge advantage in the game with everything from weapons, armour and vehicles. \nNot only that if you dont want to spend £50 on DLC's icons will apear on your screen while playing to try and get you to buy them. Including a DLC pop up that will take up your whole screen every 5 minutes even while you are in combat that will likely lead to your death.\n\nChances are you will play a match for 2 hours and get approximately 30 seconds of actual combat and that's if you are half decent at FPS games. The rest you will spend re spawning and simply travelling to the war zone.", "timestamp_created": 1617232677, "timestamp_updated": 1617232677, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.425736844539642334", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "89464153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198448697686", "personaname": "◤Primsyy◢", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Primsyy/", "num_games_owned": 73, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 9945, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 775, "last_played": 1701317338, "avatar": "a98562f84af9f58b48c4d5b69f0992900510e7e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good And Fun And BANG BANG BANG ebr hs across map", "timestamp_created": 1617232070, "timestamp_updated": 1617232070, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}